design/ecad/ring/sch-notes.md:117:Checks kept: section 7 pin plan (now with the three A5 spare rows), contact pad order, R41 and the light, P3.05 spare, designators, every pin once, single-pin nets, rails of section 3, H8, KiCad export compare. Checks removed or changed: (a) the check that each JOY line passes the wire link J2, wire, J3 (J2, J3, W5 to W10 no longer exist; A5-3 and A5-9 replace it); (b) the LR check on U5 to U8 became a SELECT check on U5, U6 (same logic); (c) the second-level R33, R34 data check and the FUNC rows for U7, U8, SW1 five-way pins and EVPAVAA1A (parts removed; A5-1, A5-3, A5-5 replace them). `prove_fail.sh` (A3 proofs) still holds the PWR_FLAG ERC probe; its first case names a pin LR that no longer exists and its output is the A3 state.
